00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:24.724
When you get engaged, people ask
you the same stupid question

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:26.326 size:75% position:38% line:92%
over and over again.

00:00:26.326 --> 00:00:29.863 align:start size:94% position:6%
