"Were you surprised?"

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:31.798 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"No.

00:00:31.798 --> 00:00:33.566 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
But I was happy."

00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:35.869 size:84% position:42% line:92%
And they're like, "Boo!

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:38.071 align:start size:94% position:6%
You should have
been surprised."

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:41.441
It's like, if you propose to
someone, and they are shocked,

00:00:41.441 --> 00:00:43.543 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
that's a bad sign.

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:44.244 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.244 --> 00:00:46.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
If they're tip-toeing
on the gazebos,

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:48.381 size:75% position:38% line:92%
they don't like you.

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:49.049 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:50.550 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then, they are like,
"How did you know?

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:52.585 align:start size:94% position:6%
How did you
figure it out?"

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:54.754 size:78% position:39% line:92%
