00:01:21.881 --> 00:01:26.586 align:start size:94% position:6%
And no matter what, they go,
"He did such a good job."

00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:30.657 align:start size:94% position:6%
It could be the ugliest thin
they have ever seen,

00:01:30.657 --> 00:01:34.160 align:start size:94% position:6%
